      },
      "message": "feat(vector): add IDL operation for vmv.v.i instruction\n\nAdd the IDL operation() implementation for the vmv.v.i (Vector Move\nImmediate) instruction. This instruction copies a sign-extended 5-bit\nimmediate value to all active elements of the destination vector\nregister group.\n\nThe implementation:\n- Calculates VLMAX based on current LMUL and SEW settings\n- Sign-extends the 5-bit immediate to SEW bits\n- Iterates through elements from vstart to vl\n- Writes the sign-extended immediate to each element\n- Resets vstart to 0\n\nAlso adds proper long_name and description fields.\n\nCloses #1393",
