      },
      "message": "test: add vmv.v.i instruction tests\n\nAdd assembly tests for the vmv.v.i (Vector Move Immediate) instruction\nfor both rv32uv and rv64uv.\n\nTests cover:\n- Positive immediate values (5, 15)\n- Negative immediate values (-1, -16)\n- Zero immediate\n- Different SEW settings (8, 16, 32, 64 bits)\n\nEach test sets up the vector configuration with vsetivli, executes\nvmv.v.i to copy the sign-extended immediate to vector elements, and\nuses vmv.x.s to extract the first element for verification.",
